OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,FSkywatchers across the UK are in for a
OL,7,Fcelestial treat on August 12, as a
OL,8,Fdeep partial solar eclipse is set to
OL,9,Funfold during the evening.
OL,11,FThe UK will experience its most
OL,12,Fimpressive solar eclipse since 1999,
OL,13,Fwith up to 96% of the Sun obscured in
OL,14,Fparts of the country.
OL,16,FExperts have urged people to make sure
OL,17,Fthey take care to protect their eyes
OL,18,Fif they wish to observe the eclipse.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
