OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,FFollowing the 1999 total solar
OL,7,Feclipse, the Royal College of
OL,8,FOphthalmologists reported around 70
OL,9,Fcases of people experiencing vision
OL,10,Fproblems after watching it. Around 40%
OL,11,Fhad looked at it for less than a
OL,12,Fminute.
OL,14,FOpticians have warned people to also
OL,15,Fdouble-check they are getting the
OL,16,Fright glasses, adding that some
OL,17,Fglasses marketed as "eclipse glasses"
OL,18,Fmay not have the correct certification.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,FThe Royal Observatory Greenwich says
OL,7,Fthey have sold out of their stock of
OL,8,Fthe glasses, while other retailers
OL,9,Falso said their stocks were low.
OL,11,FSo, what causes this exciting solar
OL,12,Fevent and how can you watch it safely?
OL,13,FITV News explains.
OL,15,FWhat is a solar eclipse, and what will
OL,16,Fit look like from Earth?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,FA solar eclipse occurs when the Moon
OL,7,Fpasses between the Sun and the Earth,
OL,8,Fmeaning they all align for a period of
OL,9,Ftime. The Moon appears to obscure the
OL,10,FSun, creating a shadow on Earth.
OL,12,FThere are four types of solar eclipse:
OL,13,FTotal, annular, hybrid, and partial.
OL,15,FNext week's eclipse is what is known
OL,16,Fas "partial" in the UK, which means
OL,17,Fthat only part of the Sun's light will
OL,18,Fbe blocked by the Moon.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,FHowever, astronomers say this will be
OL,7,Fthe most impressive eclipse visible
OL,8,Ffrom British soil since 1999.
OL,10,FOther parts of the world, including
OL,11,FGreenland, Iceland, Spain, Russia, and
OL,12,Fa small area of Portugal, will witness
OL,13,Fa total eclipse.
OL,15,FHow rare is this phenomenon?
OL,17,FSolar eclipses in and of themselves
OL,18,Fare not unusual, happening roughly
OL,19,Fevery 18 months somewhere on Earth.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,FHowever, a single place may have to
OL,7,Fwait hundreds of years to be in the
OL,8,Feclipse shadow.
OL,10,FSeeing more than 90% of the Sun
OL,11,Fcovered from parts of the British
OL,12,FIsles is a rare event, making this one
OL,13,Fespecially worth watching.
OL,15,FThe next time the Moon obscures as
OL,16,Fmuch of the Sun will be in 2081, and
OL,17,Fthe next total solar eclipse in the UK
OL,18,Fwill be in 2090.
OL,20,FWhen and where will I be able to see
OL,21,Fthe eclipse?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30907
