CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,FDepending on where you are in the UK,
OL,7,Fthe time in which you can view the
OL,8,Feclipse varies slightly. The celestial
OL,9,Fevent will last approximately 1 hour
OL,10,Fand 50 minutes in total.
OL,12,FAccording to Royal Museums Greenwich
OL,13,F(RMG), here is when you can witness
OL,14,Fthe phenomenon:
OL,16,FIn the UK, generally speaking, the
OL,17,Ffurther southwest you are, the greater
OL,18,Fthe coverage of the sun.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,FCornwall and the Isles of Scilly are
OL,7,Flikely to get the best views with up
OL,8,Fto 95%.
OL,10,FWhen choosing a viewing spot, open or
OL,11,Fraised areas without buildings or
OL,12,Ftrees and a clear view of the western
OL,13,Fhorizon are best.
OL,15,FOutside of the UK, the partial eclipse
OL,16,Fwill be visible in Europe, Africa,
OL,17,FNorth America.
OL,19,FHow can a solar eclipse be dangerous?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,FImo Bell, a planetarium astronomer at
OL,7,Fthe RGO, warns that you "can't just go
OL,8,Fout and expect to have a look" as this
OL,9,Fis dangerous for the eyes,
OL,11,F"During an eclipse, the Sun appears
OL,12,Fdimmer than usual", explains the UK
OL,13,FHealth Security Agency (UKHSA).
OL,15,F"This makes it easier to look at
OL,16,Fdirectly - and that's precisely the
OL,17,Fproblem. The reduced brightness can
OL,18,Foverride the body's natural reflex to
OL,19,Flook away, allowing intense sunlight
OL,20,Fto reach and damage the retina.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,F"This damage happens without causing
OL,7,Fany pain, so you may not realise harm
OL,8,Fis occurring until it's too late."
OL,10,FMohamed Elalfy, a consultant
OL,11,Fophthalmologist and president of the
OL,12,FRoyal College of Ophthalmologists,
OL,13,Fsaid: "The safest way to enjoy the
OL,14,Feclipse is to observe it indirectly,
OL,15,Fsuch as by watching a live broadcast.
OL,17,F"Looking directly at the Sun during a
OL,18,Fsolar eclipse can cause damage to the
OL,19,Fretina, potentially damaging the cells
OL,20,Fresponsible for sharp central vision.
OL,26,@uD@GOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30911
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,F"Crucially, the retina has no pain
OL,7,Freceptors, so people will not feel the
OL,8,Fdamage as it happens."
OL,10,FSo how can I enjoy the eclipse safely?
OL,12,FExperts say you must wear solar
OL,13,Feclipse viewing glasses, which are
OL,14,Fspecifically designed eye protection.
OL,16,FSunglasses, or 3D glasses, will not
OL,17,Fadequately protect your eyes.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30912
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,FAntonio Garcia Fernandez is part of
OL,7,FVolunteer Astronomy Observers of
OL,8,FSpain, a group of astronomers and
OL,9,Fprofessors that set up a website,
OL,10,FEclipse Seguro, to share safety
OL,11,Finformation ahead of this year's
OL,12,Feclipse.
OL,14,FFernandez warns that it is important
OL,15,Fto look out for fake glasses.
OL,17,F"Online marketplaces are currently
OL,18,Fflooded with uncertified or
OL,19,Fcounterfeit glasses with fake labels,
OL,20,Fwhich can cause permanent blind spots
OL,21,Fin seconds.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30913
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,F"To ensure your eclipse glasses are
OL,7,Flegitimate, make sure that they have
OL,8,Fsafety certification 'ISO 12312-2' or
OL,9,F'ISO 12312-2:2015' printed somewhere
OL,10,Fon the glasses", say the RMG.
OL,12,FYou should also not use glasses with
OL,13,Flenses that are scratched, torn or
OL,14,Fdamaged.
OL,16,FA safe and cheap way to witness the
OL,17,Fevent is to make a pinhole projector,
OL,18,Fwhich can be created easily at home
OL,19,Fwith minimal materials.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30914
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,F"You can project the image of the
OL,7,Feclipse using a household item like a
OL,8,Fcolander which has lots of holes in `
OL,9,Fpoint the colander towards the Sun
OL,10,Fwith your back facing it, and in the
OL,11,Fshadow of the colander you'll be able
OL,12,Fto see the eclipse in the holes, which
OL,13,Fis really cool", says Bell.
OL,15,FITV News will also be streaming the
OL,16,Fevent.
OL,18,FWill I be able to take a photo with my
OL,19,Fsmartphone?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30915
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,FIf you're photographing the Sun during
OL,7,Fthe eclipse, the lens should be
OL,8,Fprotected by a special-purpose solar
OL,9,Ffilter, or you could hold solar
OL,10,Feclipse viewing glasses up to the lens.
OL,12,FA digital SLR camera is your best bet
OL,13,Ffor dramatic close-up photos of the
OL,14,FMoon passing in front of the Sun,
OL,15,Fhowever, it is possible to take a good
OL,16,Fphoto with a smartphone.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30916
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,FiPhones and Android devices aren't
OL,7,Freally designed for photographing
OL,8,Fobjects in the sky. Their lenses are
OL,9,Fgreat for wide-angle shots but not so
OL,10,Fgood for capturing close-up detail
OL,11,Ffrom afar.
OL,13,FBut newer phones have sophisticated
OL,14,Fsensors, multiple lenses, and image
OL,15,Fstabilisation software that give you a
OL,16,Fbetter chance. Many also have exposure
OL,17,Fcontrols, so you can darken or lighten
OL,18,Fthe image amid tricky eclipse lighting.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30917
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,FZooming in, avoiding flash and
OL,7,Flowering exposure may help capture the
OL,8,Fcelestial event.
OL,10,FWhat about a selfie?
OL,12,FIt's tempting to make a TikTok or
OL,13,FInstagram-friendly eclipse video using
OL,14,Fthe selfie camera.
OL,16,FBut, while you might think your vision
OL,17,Fisn't at risk because you're not
OL,18,Flooking at the Sun, your phone's
OL,19,Fscreen could reflect harmful
OL,20,Fultraviolet light, eye experts have
OL,21,Fwarned.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
