PN,30920
SC,0020
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786468725
OL,3,CSolar eclipse UK: When and where to
OL,4,Cwatch the rare celestial phenomenon
OL,6,FOf course, the weather will have the
OL,7,Ffinal say. We'll be keeping a close
OL,8,Feye on the forecast in the lead-up to
OL,9,FWednesday, bringing you the latest
OL,10,Fcloud cover outlook to help you make
OL,11,Fthe most of this rare day-and-night
OL,12,Fastronomical show.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G20/20
